cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Codigest: codebase and terminal context manager for LLM-assisted development"
abstract: >-
  Command-line tool that extracts project snapshots, change-tracked diffs,
  structural (semantic) diffs and captured terminal output as LLM-ready XML,
  and serves them to AI agents over MCP.
